pages.description:
Site-builder document. For emails this is almost always a single
page with a sequence of layout blocks. Each layout is one of:
- 'one-column': single HTML column (most common)
- 'two-column': side-by-side HTML columns
- 'event-block': structured event card (image + name + date + link)
A minimal valid value:
{ pages: [{ id: 'page:1', layouts: [
{ id: 'layout:1', type: 'one-column',
content: '<p>Hi {{name}}!</p>', cardHeight: 100 }
] }] }

